r the cave using a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32662,32742,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32662, 32742, 7)</a> or <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32678,32611,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32678, 32611, 7)</a>. The cave furthest south, with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rats</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bugs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, is also connected to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda%2FBandit%20Caves\">Tiquanda Bandit Caves</a>, accessible through the hole located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32555,32679,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32555, 32679, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Port Hope Swamp Trolls</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\"><img alt=\"Cave Rat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cave_Rat_f0f59a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">10 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_lo