li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Eye\">Bonelord Eye</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Rod\">Terra Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Bonelord Shield (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps\">Maps</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"PH Swamp Troll 1a\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"204\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/PH_Swamp_Troll_1a_2b5c84.png\" width=\"199\"/></span><br/>\nThe first floor, filled with cave rats, bugs and spiders.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"PH Swamp Troll 1b\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"219\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/PH_Swamp_Troll_1b_8cfb8a.png\" width=\"177\"/></span><br/>\nA lot of swamp trolls in this room. Also an exit to the surface.\n</p><p><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"PH Swamp Troll 2a\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"234\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/PH_Swamp_Troll_2a_1d4c3d.png\" width=\"179\"/></span><br/>\nSecond floor, swamp trolls and poison spiders.\n</p><p><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"PH Swamp Troll 2b\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"252\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/PH_Swamp_Troll_2b_346cb7.png\" width=\"244\"/></span><br/>\nThe main floor, swamp trolls, poison spiders and skeletons, red circle is the bonelord hole and blue is the holy crab spawn.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"PH Swamp Troll 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"322\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/PH_Swamp_Troll_3_0b8c7d.png\" width=\"303\"/></span><br/>\nThird floor, swamp trolls, poison spiders, the bonelord spawn (north-east cave) and holy crab cave (north-west).\n</p></div>","quests":["swamp-fever-world-change"]}